# AVIF copies of the images the pages display, and the two icons, all made by
# scripts/site-images.mjs. The PNGs stay: pepe-video.png and gigachad-video.png are the exact
# 1344x768 frames fal conditions on, and logo.png is the pump.fun coin image and the Solana Pay
# wallet icon.
!/public/logo.avif
!/public/pepe-video.avif
!/public/gigachad-video.avif
# The example look the sponsorship card shows before payment: a real order's tee and cap on
# each host, from the devnet rehearsal of 2026-09-14.
